    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400902/2004009020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あはは、それであんなに\r\n悩んだ声出してたのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004009020150,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "…………\r\nた、例えば……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400902/2004009020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004009020160,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ぷ、プロデューサーやったら\r\n何貰ったらうれしか……？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400902/2004009020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ　俺か？\r\nうーん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "改めてそう聞かれると\r\n難しいけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004009020170,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "高級のがよか～とか\r\n手作りがよか～とか……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400902/2004009020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004009020180,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "甘くないほうがよか～とか、酸っぱかやつがよか～とか\r\nサクサクのやつがよか～とか……",
